B.PR=A.a(s(["Conjugate `\xeatre`: `je suis`, `tu es`, `il/elle est`, `nous sommes`, `vous \xeates`, `ils/elles sont`.","Add the past participle: `aller -> all\xe9`, `venir -> venu`, `partir -> parti`, `arriver -> arriv\xe9`.","Make agreement with the subject: `elle est arriv\xe9e`, `nous sommes arriv\xe9s`, `elles sont venues`.","Use `\xeatre` for common verbs like `aller`, `venir`, `arriver`, `partir`, `entrer`, `sortir`, `rester`, `tomber`, `na\xeetre`, `mourir`."]),t.s)
