B.PQ=A.a(s([B.Kd]),t.B)
B.JM=new A.bk(38,"Direct Object Pronouns: le, la, les","A2","Replace a direct object (thing/person directly receiving action).","`le/la/l'/les` before conjugated verb; before infinitive in two-verb structures",B.Qq,"In pass\xe9 compos\xe9 with avoir, preceding DO can trigger agreement: Je l'ai vue (fem).","Direct object pronouns replace the thing or person directly receiving the action.","Ask `verb + who/what?` If the answer is direct, use `le`, `la`, `l'`, or `les`. The pronoun usually goes before the conjugated verb.",B.a0y,B.PQ,"Do not keep both the noun and pronoun together: `Je le regarde`, not `Je le regarde le film`.")
