B.JP=new A.bk(40,"Present Progressive: \xeatre en train de","A2","Emphasize that an action is happening right now.","present of `\xeatre` + `en train de/d'` + infinitive",B.NM,"French present alone can mean I do or I am doing; this adds emphasis.","Use `\xeatre en train de` when you want to stress that the action is happening right now.","French present tense can already mean `I am doing`. This structure adds focus: the action is in progress at this exact moment.",B.Q4,B.PX,"Do not conjugate both verbs: say `je suis en train de lire`, not `je suis en train de lis`.")
