B.JL=new A.bk(42,"Simple Future","A2","Use the simple future for future events, predictions, promises.","infinitive + `-ai`, `-as`, `-a`, `-ons`, `-ez`, `-ont`",B.Td,"Irregular stems: \xeatre\u2192ser-, avoir\u2192aur-, aller\u2192ir-, faire\u2192fer-, venir\u2192viendr-.","For regular verbs, the future is infinitive stem + future ending.","The simple future is a one-word future tense. For most verbs, keep the infinitive as the stem. For `-re` verbs, drop the final `e`. Then add the same endings for every verb.",B.a1i,B.a0z,"The endings attach to the future stem, not the present stem: `je serai`, not `je suisai`.")
