B.JW=new A.bk(51,"Irregular Forms By Tense","A2","Each tense asks you to remember a different irregular piece: present form, past participle, imparfait stem, future stem, or helper verb.","tense -> form to memorize -> example",B.a_z,"Use this card as the master irregular table for the tenses in this quiz.","Use this as the irregular-form map for every tense and structure practiced in the quiz.","Each tense has a different thing to memorize. Present needs full irregular forms. Pass\xe9 compos\xe9 needs the right auxiliary and past participle. Imparfait usually needs the present `nous` stem. Futur simple needs the future stem. Futur proche, pass\xe9 r\xe9cent, and pr\xe9sent progressif depend on one irregular helper verb.",B.Yf,B.LB,"Do not memorize one giant rule for every tense. Ask: does this tense need a present form, a past participle, an imparfait stem, or a future stem?")
